00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:52.212 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Vendredi on verra.

00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:53.280 size:53% position:73% line:68%
On pourra peut-être assurer que

00:01:44.171 --> 00:01:54.348 size:53% position:73% line:68%
cette fois ça va marcher.

00:01:52.546 --> 00:01:55.382 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Oui, mais comme vous dîtes

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:57.484 size:53% position:73% line:68%
c'est rassurant aussi, ça veut

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:58.518 size:53% position:73% line:68%
dire qu'on apprend aucune

00:01:57.417 --> 00:02:00.587 size:53% position:73% line:68%
chance.

00:01:57.818 --> 00:02:01.621 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Pourquoi la fenêtre est si

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:02.689 size:53% position:73% line:68%
petite comme ça?

00:02:00.921 --> 00:02:04.791 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Parce que la lune bouge, mais on

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:05.826 size:53% position:73% line:68%
peut changer la trajectoire,

00:02:04.725 --> 00:02:07.895 size:53% position:73% line:68%
non?

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:09.997 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Aujourd'hui c'était deux

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:20.440 size:53% position:73% line:68%
