00:02:23.911 --> 00:02:29.850 size:53% position:73% line:68%
que le vaisseau spatial passe

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:30.917 size:53% position:73% line:68%
dans l'ombre de la terre.

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:31.952 size:53% position:73% line:68%
On peut penser à dans deux

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:32.986 size:53% position:73% line:68%
semaines quand on revient si on

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:35.088 size:53% position:73% line:68%
a des bonnes conditions pour

00:02:32.286 --> 00:02:36.123 size:53% position:73% line:68%
revenir, c'est un calendrier

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:42.462 size:53% position:73% line:68%
compliqué.

00:02:35.422 --> 00:02:43.497 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Le prochain bloc vendredi

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:44.531 size:53% position:73% line:68%
prochain.

00:02:42.796 --> 00:02:49.770 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Pourquoi on retourne,

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:50.804 size:53% position:73% line:68%
justement va retourner autour de

00:02:49.703 --> 00:02:51.872 size:53% position:73% line:68%
la Lune.

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:52.906 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Artémis deux sera habitée par

00:02:51.138 --> 00:02:53.941 size:53% position:73% line:68%
