00:03:48.795 --> 00:03:58.939 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Oui évidemment.

00:03:55.068 --> 00:04:00.040 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Quand je regardais la terre et

00:03:56.136 --> 00:04:06.313 size:53% position:73% line:68%
