00:04:21.361 --> 00:04:25.198 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Maintenant cela génération

00:04:22.396 --> 00:04:26.233 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Artémis, on retombe sur la lune

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:31.471 size:53% position:73% line:68%
