00:04:25.532 --> 00:04:32.506 size:53% position:73% line:68%
On fera une station en orbite

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:33.540 size:53% position:73% line:68%
autour de la lune et c'est pour

00:04:31.805 --> 00:04:34.608 size:53% position:73% line:68%
